room	12	4	44	1	196
name	Up a Tree
desc	You are about 10 feet above the ground nestled among some large branches. The nearest branch above you is above your reach. On the ground below you can see: .
items	bird's nest
exit	DOWN	to	7	Forest Path
exit	UP	blocked	0	You cannot climb any higher.
endroom
room	13	24	44	0	231
name	Canyon View
desc	You are at the top of the Great Canyon on its west wall. From here there is a marvelous view of the canyon and parts of the Frigid River upstream. Across the canyon, the walls of the White Cliffs join the mighty ramparts of the Flathead Mountains to the east. Following the Canyon upstream to the north, Aragain Falls may be seen, complete with rainbow. The mighty Frigid River flows out from a great dark cavern. To the west and south can be seen an immense forest, stretching for miles around. A path leads northwest. It is possible to climb down into the canyon from here.
items	
exit	EAST	to	16	Rocky Ledge
exit	DOWN	to	16	Rocky Ledge
exit	NW	to	10	Clearing
exit	WEST	to	8	Forest
exit	SOUTH	blocked	0	Storm-tossed trees block your way.
endroom
room	14	16	12	N	240
name	Grating Room
desc	You are in a small room near the maze. There are twisty passages in the immediate vicinity. Above you is an open grating with sunlight pouring in. Above you is a grating. Above you is a grating locked with a skull-and-crossbones lock.
items	
exit	SW	to	0	Maze
exit	UP	cond	9	Clearing
endroom
room	15	8	52	0	231
name	Forest
desc	The forest thins out, revealing impassable mountains.
items	mountain range
