exit	EAST	blocked	0	The mountains are impassable.
exit	SOUTH	to	11	Forest
exit	WEST	to	11	Forest
endroom
room	16	28	36	0	231
name	Rocky Ledge
desc	You are on a ledge about halfway up the wall of the river canyon. You can see from here that the main flow from Aragain Falls twists along a passage which it is impossible for you to enter. Below you is the canyon bottom. Above you is more cliff, which appears climbable.
items	
exit	UP	to	13	Canyon View
exit	DOWN	to	17	Canyon Bottom
endroom
room	17	32	28	-1	88
name	Canyon Bottom
desc	You are beneath the walls of the river canyon which may be climbable here. The lesser part of the runoff of Aragain Falls flows by below. To the north is a narrow path.
items	
exit	UP	to	16	Rocky Ledge
exit	NORTH	to	18	End of Rainbow
endroom
room	18	28	28	-1	88
name	End of Rainbow
desc	You are on a small, rocky beach on the continuation of the Frigid River past the Falls. The beach is narrow due to the presence of the White Cliffs. The river canyon opens here and sunlight shines in from above. A rainbow crosses over the falls to the east and a narrow path continues to the southwest.
items	pot of gold
tele	20	Aragain Falls	use the rainbow
exit	UP	cond	19	On the Rainbow
exit	NE	cond	19	On the Rainbow
exit	EAST	cond	19	On the Rainbow
exit	SW	to	17	Canyon Bottom
endroom
room	19	24	20	0	231
name	On the Rainbow
desc	You are on top of a rainbow (I bet you never thought you would walk on a rainbow), with a magnificent view of the Falls. The rainbow travels east-west here.
items	
exit	WEST	to	18	End of Rainbow
exit	EAST	to	20	Aragain Falls
endroom
room	20	24	28	0	231
name	Aragain Falls
desc	You are at the top of Aragain Falls, an enormous waterfall with a drop of about 450 feet. The only path here is on the north end. A solid rainbow spans the falls. A beautiful rainbow can be seen over the falls and to the west.
items	
tele	18	End of Rainbow	use the rainbow
exit	WEST	cond	19	On the Rainbow
exit	DOWN	blocked	0	It's a long way...
exit	NORTH	to	21	Shore
exit	UP	cond	19	On the Rainbow
endroom
room	21	20	28	0	231
name	Shore
desc	You are on the east shore of the river. The water here seems somewhat treacherous. A path travels from north to south here, the south end quickly turning around a sharp corner.
items	
exit	NORTH	to	90	Sandy Beach
exit	SOUTH	to	20	Aragain Falls
endroom
room	22	16	36	0	231
name	Kitchen
desc	You are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark staircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open. slightly ajar.
items	kitchen table
exit	EAST	cond	6	Behind House
exit	WEST	to	25	Living Room
exit	OUT	cond	6	Behind House
exit	UP	to	23	Attic
exit	DOWN	cond	24	Studio
endroom
room	23	12	28	1	196
name	Attic
desc	This is the attic. The only exit is a stairway leading down.
items	table|rope
exit	DOWN	to	22	Kitchen
endroom
room	24	20	44	-1	88
name	Studio
desc	This appears to have been an artist's studio. The walls and floors are splattered with paints of 69 different colors. Strangely enough, nothing of value is hanging here. At the south end of the room is an open door (also covered with paint). A dark and narrow chimney leads up from a fireplace; although you might be able to get up it, it seems unlikely you could get back down.
items	ZORK owner's manual
exit	SOUTH	to	86	Gallery
exit	UP	per	0	
endroom
room	25	16	44	0	231
name	Living Room
desc	You are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east . To the west is a cyclops-shaped opening in an old wooden door, above which is some strange gothic lettering, , a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy case, and a rug lying beside an open trap door. and a closed trap door at your feet. and an open trap door at your feet. and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.
items	trophy case|carpet|trap door|brass lantern|wooden door|sword
alt	MAGIC-FLAG	You are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east , a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.	You are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east . To the west is a cyclops-shaped opening in an old wooden door, above which is some strange gothic lettering, a trophy case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.
exit	EAST	to	22	Kitchen
exit	WEST	cond	26	Strange Passage
exit	DOWN	per	0	
endroom
room	26	16	52	0	231
name	Strange Passage
desc	This is a long passage. To the west is one entrance. On the east there is an old wooden door, with a large opening in it (about cyclops sized).
items	
exit	WEST	to	27	Cyclops Room
exit	IN	to	27	Cyclops Room
exit	EAST	to	25	Living Room
endroom
room	27	16	60	0	231
name	Cyclops Room
desc	This room has an exit on the northwest, and a staircase leading up. The cyclops is sleeping blissfully at the foot of the stairs. The east wall, previously solid, now has a cyclops-sized opening in it. A cyclops, who looks prepared to eat horses (much less mere adventurers), blocks the staircase. From his state of health, and the bloodstains on the walls, you gather that he is not very friendly, though he likes people. The cyclops is standing in the corner, eyeing you closely. I don't think he likes you very much. He looks extremely hungry, even for a cyclops. The cyclops, having eaten the hot peppers, appears to be gasping. His enflamed tongue protrudes from his man-sized mouth.
items	cyclops
alt	MAGIC-FLAG	This room has an exit on the northwest, and a staircase leading up.	This room has an exit on the northwest, and a staircase leading up. The east wall, previously solid, now has a cyclops-sized opening in it.
exit	NW	to	0	Maze
exit	EAST	cond	26	Strange Passage
exit	UP	cond	28	Treasure Room
endroom
room	28	12	68	1	196
name	Treasure Room
desc	This is a large room, whose east wall is solid granite. A number of discarded bags, which crumble at your touch, are scattered about on the floor. There is an exit down a staircase.
items	chalice
exit	DOWN	to	27	Cyclops Room
endroom
room	29	20	52	-1	88
name	Cellar
desc	You are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is unclimbable.
items	
exit	NORTH	to	61	The Troll Room
exit	SOUTH	to	30	East of Chasm
exit	UP	cond	25	Living Room
exit	WEST	blocked	0	You try to ascend the ramp, but it is impossible, and you slide back down.
endroom
room	30	24	52	-1	88
name	East of Chasm
desc	You are on the east edge of a chasm, the bottom of which cannot be seen. A narrow passage goes north, and the path you are on continues to the east.
items	
exit	NORTH	to	29	Cellar
exit	EAST	to	86	Gallery
exit	DOWN	blocked	0	The chasm probably leads straight to the infernal regions.
endroom
room	31	24	60	-1	88
name	Slide Room
desc	This is a small chamber, which appears to have been part of a coal mine. On the south wall of the chamber the letters "Granite Wall" are etched in the rock. To the east is a long passage, and there is a steep metal slide twisting downward. To the north is a small opening.
items	
exit	EAST	to	32	Cold Passage
exit	NORTH	to	33	Mine Entrance
exit	DOWN	to	29	Cellar
endroom
room	32	24	68	-1	88
name	Cold Passage
desc	This is a cold and damp corridor where a long east-west passageway turns into a southward path.
items	
exit	SOUTH	to	34	Mirror Room
exit	WEST	to	31	Slide Room
endroom
room	33	20	60	-1	88
name	Mine Entrance
desc	You are standing at the entrance of what might have been a coal mine. The shaft enters the west wall, and there is another exit on the south end of the room.
items	
exit	SOUTH	to	31	Slide Room
exit	IN	to	35	Squeaky Room
exit	WEST	to	35	Squeaky Room
endroom
room	34	28	68	-1	88
name	Mirror Room
desc	You are in a large square room with tall ceilings. On the south wall is an enormous mirror which fills the entire wall. There are exits on the other three sides of the room. Unfortunately, the mirror has been destroyed by your recklessness.
items	mirror
alt	MIRROR-MUNG	You are in a large square room with tall ceilings. On the south wall is an enormous mirror which fills the entire wall. There are exits on the other three sides of the room.	You are in a large square room with tall ceilings. On the south wall is an enormous mirror which fills the entire wall. There are exits on the other three sides of the room. Unfortunately, the mirror has been destroyed by your recklessness.
