room	40	16	76	-1	88
name	Shaft Room
desc	This is a large room, in the middle of which is a small shaft descending through the floor into darkness below. To the west and the north are exits from this room. Constructed over the top of the shaft is a metal framework to which a heavy iron chain is attached.
items	basket
exit	DOWN	blocked	0	You wouldn't fit and would die if you could.
exit	WEST	to	38	Bat Room
exit	NORTH	to	42	Smelly Room
endroom
room	41	36	68	-2	130
name	Reservoir North
desc	You are in a large cavernous room, the south of which was formerly a lake. However, with the water level lowered, there is merely a wide stream running through there. You are in a large cavernous area. To the south is a wide lake, whose water level appears to be falling rapidly. You are in a cavernous area, to the south of which is a very wide stream. The level of the stream is rising rapidly, and it appears that before long it will be impossible to cross to the other side. You are in a large cavernous room, north of a large lake. There is a slimy stairway leaving the room to the north.
items	hand-held air pump
exit	NORTH	to	39	Atlantis Room
exit	SOUTH	cond	43	Reservoir
endroom
room	42	12	76	-1	88
name	Smelly Room
desc	This is a small nondescript room. However, from the direction of a small descending staircase a foul odor can be detected. To the south is a narrow tunnel.
items	
exit	DOWN	to	44	Gas Room
exit	SOUTH	to	40	Shaft Room
endroom
room	43	40	68	-2	130
name	Reservoir
desc	You are on what used to be a large lake, but which is now a large mud pile. There are "shores" to the north and south. You are on the lake. Beaches can be seen north and south. Upstream a small stream enters the lake through a narrow cleft in the rocks. The dam can be seen downstream.
items	trunk of jewels
exit	NORTH	to	41	Reservoir North
exit	SOUTH	to	45	Reservoir South
exit	UP	to	46	Stream
exit	WEST	to	46	Stream
exit	DOWN	blocked	0	The dam blocks your way.
endroom
room	44	16	84	-2	130
name	Gas Room
desc	This is a small room which smells strongly of coal gas. There is a short climb up some stairs and a narrow tunnel leading east.
items	sapphire-encrusted bracelet
exit	UP	to	42	Smelly Room
exit	EAST	to	47	Coal Mine
endroom
room	45	44	68	-2	130
name	Reservoir South
desc	You are in a long room, to the north of which was formerly a lake. However, with the water level lowered, there is merely a wide stream running through the center of the room. You are in a long room. To the north is a large lake, too deep to cross. You notice, however, that the water level appears to be dropping at a rapid rate. Before long, it might be possible to cross to the other side from here. You are in a long room, to the north of which is a wide area which was formerly a reservoir, but now is merely a stream. You notice, however, that the level of the stream is rising quickly and that before long it will be impossible to cross here. You are in a long room on the south shore of a large lake, far too deep and wide for crossing. There is a path along the stream to the east or west, a steep pathway climbing southwest along the edge of a chasm, and a path leading into a canyon to the southeast.
items	
exit	SE	to	48	Deep Canyon
exit	SW	to	49	Chasm
exit	EAST	to	50	Dam
exit	WEST	to	51	Stream View
exit	NORTH	cond	43	Reservoir
endroom
room	46	36	76	-1	88
name	Stream
desc	You are on the gently flowing stream. The upstream route is too narrow to navigate, and the downstream route is invisible due to twisting walls. There is a narrow beach to land on.
items	
