name	Deep Canyon
desc	You are on the south edge of a deep canyon. Passages lead off to the east, northwest and southwest. A stairway leads down. You can hear a loud roaring sound, like that of rushing water, from below. You can hear the sound of flowing water from below.
items	
exit	NW	to	45	Reservoir South
exit	EAST	to	50	Dam
exit	SW	to	53	North-South Passage
exit	DOWN	to	54	Loud Room
endroom
